# Inventory and secrets

Adding a host requires all of: `Makefile` lists, `config/fleet-inventory.nix`,
`hosts/<name>/`, `secrets/<name>/secrets.yaml`, `ssh/fleet_known_hosts`, flake
`nixosConfigurations`. Then `make check-inventory` and
`make edit-secrets HOST=<name>` / `make updatekeys`.

The two host lists are allowed to exist; they must not drift
(`docs/adr/2026-08-29-inventory-check.md`). CI runs `check-inventory` in `test`
without `ATTIC_TOKEN`. `make check-secrets` is local (age key); CI only
eval-checks that declared secrets exist.

Per-host sops files. No shared secret file. Creation rules in `.sops.yaml` map
each `secrets/<host>/` to `alex` plus that host's age key.
